# URL regexes that lychee skips, one per line. Escape ., ?, +, ( and ); anchor
# with ^, and with $ for a single URL:
#   ^https://example\.org/page$     one URL
#   ^https://(www\.)?example\.com/  a whole host
#
# Put a comment above every entry. For a reachability reason, add the date:
#   # Reachable but fails the link check. (Last access: YYYY-MM-DD)
#   # Historical reference; the URL is no longer reachable. (Last access: YYYY-MM-DD)
# Otherwise give the reason, with no date:
#   # <reason>
